    CheckPillarInput -- Có --> MatchPillar
    MatchPillar -.->|Không khớp| WaitPillar2
    WaitPillar2 -.-> MatchPillar
    MatchPillar -->|Khớp| SetPillar
    
    SetPillar --> ReadLog1
    
