    WaitDup1 -->|Tiếp tục| RunScript
    DupCheck1 -->|Không| RunScript
    
    %% S3
    RunScript --> MatchScript
    MatchScript -->|Có| CheckAudience
    MatchScript -->|Không| GenTopic
    
    %% S4
    GenTopic --> MapTopic
    
    %% S5
    MapTopic --> MatchMap
    MatchMap -->|Có| CheckAudience
    MatchMap -->|Không| CheckAuth1
    
    %% S6
